### CREATE PROFESSOR

POST http://localhost:5000/api/admin/professor
Content-Type: application/json
# Branch value must be same as Admin Branch
{
  "name": "Sujal Zala",
  "email": "sujalzala66@gmail.com",
  "contactNumber": "9876543210",
  "branchValue": "Chemical Engineering",
  "statusId": 25
}

### GET ALL PROFESSOR
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/professor
Content-Type: application/json

### GET PROFESSOR BY ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/professor/6
Content-Type: application/json

